    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25827" root="ضرو and ضرى" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَرِىٌّ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِرْوٌ</span>, first sentence. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Applied to a
vein, (S, M, K, TA,) (tropical:)  <i>Flowing;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَارٍ</span></b> :
(M:) or <i>flowing much;</i> (TA;) <i>of which the
blood hardly,</i> or <i>in nowise, stops;</i> (S, K, TA;) as
though it were habituated to the flowing. (TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِرَآءٌ</span>.

